{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：11:00 2026-11-21 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"吳婉芳長子胡智略結婚5周年  新抱霍詠盈：期待50年  舉家入住8層高2萬呎豪宅\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fd933f627ffa214cd7b657e462196385/2026-11/Copy_of_KF__105.png\"/>\n<p>59歲的吳婉芳一向被封為「凍齡女神」，其長子胡智略與霍英東二房孫女霍詠盈迎來結婚5周年紀念日，向來低調的霍詠盈日前罕有在社交平台大方放閃，貼出多張甜蜜合照，更大爆二人緣分深厚，從昔日的中學「剋星」演變成倫敦地鐵車廂重逢的浪漫橋段，發表深情告白，羨煞旁人。</p>\n<h2>胡智略太太長文感謝老公包容</h2>\n<p>霍詠盈比起31歲的胡智略年長2年，二人背景相仿，同曾留學英國，兩人於2021年11月共諧連理。近日霍詠盈在社交平台撰寫長文，細數與丈夫從校園到婚後的奇妙緣分，笑指中學時期的他們一個是循規蹈矩的音樂風紀，另一個則是痞帥淘氣的體育生，原本互為「剋星」，長大後卻在倫敦地鐵車廂意外重逢。她感性表示，這簡直是「短劇才會出現的橋段」，並感謝丈夫5年來的包容、疼愛與支持，笑言每天對著老公的「高顏值」讓自己潛移默化變美，甚至連對方的「戰略性耍廢」也能甘之如飴，誓言要與丈夫攜手白頭。她表示：「總是支持我，想當女強人或當個小孩子亦可，也謝謝你那看不厭的美貌，讓我五年來每天對住你，潛移默化地變美」，「我愛五年前的你，愛現在的你，會繼續愛五年後的你，期待我們以後的五年、十年、五十年」。</p>\n<img alt=\"吳婉芳育有兩子一女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ad04b5a66d5e72b3889a7882e371f535/2023-03/275461768_152325800578984_1924275549348745566_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳婉芳大仔胡智略2021年迎娶霍英東孫女霍詠盈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b8bafcd7141a8b13901fe626d1383e45/2023-05/lynuswoo_257150861_438045114509152_6274920142994977850_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡智略和太太霍英東孫女霍詠盈，一家人大合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc1a420262f71e6495fba98a634ed23f/2022-05/w1200.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"二人甜蜜相擁自拍，幸福滿瀉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c1b18e31efa663370e6c9992bf4ec283/2026-11/SaveClip_App_907672152_18681883528032646_4726742281329853775_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"霍詠盈分享與老公胡智略的恩愛合照，慶祝兩人結婚5周年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/791f6202426e17451998ef03e7f9f624/2026-11/SaveClip_App_909638535_18681883375032646_5501709028385883490_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"兩夫婦恩愛同遊，貼面自拍流露滿滿的甜蜜與默契。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/03b647f114d36ffaf3bd7a8faf1a665b/2026-11/SaveClip_App_910169930_18681883480032646_22165115827429310_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"二人不時周遊列國，被讚人生勝利組。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/137d4697aa7051f321ee61fab1f7d8ad/2026-11/SaveClip_App_910819312_18681883519032646_7300832191108809640_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"霍詠盈甜蜜感謝對方5年來的呵護。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c65c5655c2d7943a963778e9d498c06f/2026-11/SaveClip_App_912006154_18681883390032646_7535342486519063714_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"霍詠盈感謝丈夫讓她無需偽裝，想當女強人或小孩子都可以。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/de41d930d01d0bcfafa63c395063722e/2026-11/SaveClip_App_912225619_18681883429032646_3542329156280747853_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"霍詠盈分享與老公胡智略合照，高調放閃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4da9a1775df33fa8acd75095b2cdc2ba/2026-11/SaveClip_App_913894377_18681883462032646_4540440324415664932_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡智略與霍詠盈在2021年結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ecbc439de5e91ae426851eb0a360ebcf/2022-10/Caroline%20%2829%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡智略和霍詠盈好襯。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b5b8e7e81a5f7270a168e85789be056f/2022-10/caroline_32.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡智略和霍詠盈好襯。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/125ca58f2cdf08cb64a6c891a3fa66fe/2022-10/caroline_41.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"2022年展開4個月的歐遊蜜月之旅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0d31a67bb37d279ad4726b17a1f31c0/2022-10/caroline_20.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"霍詠盈去到葡萄牙，以葡語「我背後的男人」形容老公。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f900c1aeaa79154c1cacba3c43a91717/2022-10/caroline_12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"霍詠盈冧爆留言，要與胡智略牽手一輩子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1dee7038b11027ce19f2a3e7535a2265/2022-10/caroline_19.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"霍詠盈打上「胡先生、胡太太」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ac912b993cec7b7e1487d3f502cf9130/2022-10/caroline_25.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蜜月尾站為英國倫敦。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/19c111801731d4c700e1a1245cb2b77a/2022-10/caroline_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"二人繼續周遊列國。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fc8534701cf897252671e7c23659273c/2023-06/FOK_02_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"早前霍詠盈在小紅書上發佈了一段影片正式宣佈加入小紅書，當中她與胡智略一起回到南沙及番禺尋根，更穿著古風服飾，十分有情趣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/79de6d477f0da18a4b218cc22c138e25/2025-05/Kf-wTtqeYDwHCfCbnHOvN34veGUIZfiHAW4AIgFuACI.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"霍詠盈的黑色透視裝靚到殺死人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ba7bfc470f48c99efac45899496ea50d/2024-12/Gorgeous_carolinefwy_dazzles_in_our_beaded_embellished_evening_gown_bringing_all_the_festive_vibe_and_holiday_glam_Explore_our_stylish_wardrobe_at_thewe_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"霍詠盈這套衫極其性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/da5affc27b7ca30c4cb87e22124a3f15/2024-12/Gorgeous_carolinefwy_dazzles_in_our_beaded_embellished_evening_gown_bringing_all_the_festive_vibe_and_holiday_glam_Explore_our_stylish_wardrobe_at_thewe_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"霍詠盈挑戰性感底線。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1819258293f99d1cee99c16c552700a6/2024-12/Gorgeous_carolinefwy_dazzles_in_our_beaded_embellished_evening_gown_bringing_all_the_festive_vibe_and_holiday_glam_Explore_our_stylish_wardrobe_at_thewe_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"霍詠盈和胡智略於街頭錫錫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/889b00d6533f517c55ad6b909e804e11/2024-12/Gorgeous_carolinefwy_dazzles_in_our_beaded_embellished_evening_gown_bringing_all_the_festive_vibe_and_holiday_glam_Explore_our_stylish_wardrobe_at_thewe_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"霍詠盈胡智略這輯相好有Mood。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2641d972164d2eec8e6d6a8377844267/2024-12/Gorgeous_carolinefwy_dazzles_in_our_beaded_embellished_evening_gown_bringing_all_the_festive_vibe_and_holiday_glam_Explore_our_stylish_wardrobe_at_thewe_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"霍詠盈明艷照人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/286f8db3092b4dc88577fa437e06add3/2024-12/Gorgeous_carolinefwy_dazzles_in_our_beaded_embellished_evening_gown_bringing_all_the_festive_vibe_and_holiday_glam_Explore_our_stylish_wardrobe_at_thewe_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"霍詠盈拖着胡智略。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3756187aad130502c82a1cc14c0de6f3/2024-12/Gorgeous_carolinefwy_dazzles_in_our_beaded_embellished_evening_gown_bringing_all_the_festive_vibe_and_holiday_glam_Explore_our_stylish_wardrobe_at_thewe_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"霍詠盈眼神殺死人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d6f8e6013337277bff572cc5fb7af197/2024-12/Gorgeous_carolinefwy_dazzles_in_our_beaded_embellished_evening_gown_bringing_all_the_festive_vibe_and_holiday_glam_Explore_our_stylish_wardrobe_at_thewe_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"霍詠盈的黑色透視裝靚到殺死人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bb22bea100e89ecb3986ac1eb6a32690/2024-12/Gorgeous_carolinefwy_dazzles_in_our_beaded_embellished_evening_gown_bringing_all_the_festive_vibe_and_holiday_glam_Explore_our_stylish_wardrobe_at_thewe_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"霍詠盈這輯相極盡性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7d9ec2bcef77e91e70a0a7d422c6ead4/2024-12/Gorgeous_carolinefwy_dazzles_in_our_beaded_embellished_evening_gown_bringing_all_the_festive_vibe_and_holiday_glam_Explore_our_stylish_wardrobe_at_theweddin.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"霍詠盈的蝴蝶紋身好搶眼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c2827feddf33a3031e738838e05e1b9b/2024-12/carolinefwy_captivates_the_night_in_our_Renee_gown_illuminated_with_crystals_and_sequins_appearing_ever_so_chic_timeless_and_festive_Find_dresses_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"霍詠盈深愛老公。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d6453a1fe739f3941408a373bfdd274c/2024-12/carolinefwy_captivates_the_night_in_our_Renee_gown_illuminated_with_crystals_and_sequins_appearing_ever_so_chic_timeless_and_festive_Find_dresses_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"霍詠盈撥弄秀髮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7bcfce7883f510a21a8b2676102a32bd/2024-12/carolinefwy_captivates_the_night_in_our_Renee_gown_illuminated_with_crystals_and_sequins_appearing_ever_so_chic_timeless_and_festive_Find_dresses_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡智略深情望着霍詠盈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/258a95c06b7f8b8a98bc6b91ad3c7c78/2024-12/carolinefwy_captivates_the_night_in_our_Renee_gown_illuminated_with_crystals_and_sequins_appearing_ever_so_chic_timeless_and_festive_Find_dresses_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"霍詠盈風姿綽約。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c5187429d5c9ac598a7bd8aebfc08db/2024-12/carolinefwy_captivates_the_night_in_our_Renee_gown_illuminated_with_crystals_and_sequins_appearing_ever_so_chic_timeless_and_festive_Find_dresses_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡智略霍詠盈好有默契。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2505d095e699192e0f8471617f95af6b/2024-12/carolinefwy_captivates_the_night_in_our_Renee_gown_illuminated_with_crystals_and_sequins_appearing_ever_so_chic_timeless_and_festive_Find_dresses_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"霍詠盈騷一雙長腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e8ff8e20095fd47a8d4150a1d2c66e5f/2024-12/carolinefwy_captivates_the_night_in_our_Renee_gown_illuminated_with_crystals_and_sequins_appearing_ever_so_chic_timeless_and_festive_Find_dresses_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡智略霍詠盈呢張相好有Feel。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c4084761ae729a78c24c052264fae70/2024-12/carolinefwy_captivates_the_night_in_our_Renee_gown_illuminated_with_crystals_and_sequins_appearing_ever_so_chic_timeless_and_festive_Find_dresses_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡智略霍詠盈郎才女貌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5eb168b20f5d8f85acd554bd1a32681a/2024-12/carolinefwy_captivates_the_night_in_our_Renee_gown_illuminated_with_crystals_and_sequins_appearing_ever_so_chic_timeless_and_festive_Find_dresses_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡智略霍詠盈錫得肉緊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c8abb1d14addc0d28cb3d16fbe0cb298/2024-12/carolinefwy_captivates_the_night_in_our_Renee_gown_illuminated_with_crystals_and_sequins_appearing_ever_so_chic_timeless_and_festive_Find_dresses_wort.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳婉芳二仔今年5月結婚，一家人的感情十分融洽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7dda720f8387425288af99f24de00c09/2026-05/a001_13_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>吳婉芳一家住2萬呎8層獨立屋</h2>\n<p>吳婉芳與子女及新抱一同居住於大坑一棟樓高8層、面積達2萬呎的超巨型獨立屋。這棟豪宅外觀極具現代設計感，曾榮獲國際設計及建築大獎，內部更配套有私人大泳池和巨型露台。從日常照中可見，巨型客廳裝潢高貴典雅，牆上更掛滿了溫馨的全家福。一向與新抱關係極為融洽的吳婉芳，今年8月出席好友上山詩納的生日派對時，因極致凍齡的少女外貌再次成為全城熱話，被網民大讚是「全港最美奶奶」。</p>\n<h2>吳婉芳二仔今年5月結婚</h2>\n<p>吳婉芳今年更是喜事連連，除了大仔胡智略恩愛依舊，一向活躍於社交平台、外形健碩的二仔胡智同，亦於今年5月低調與女友結婚，令胡家再添喜事。吳婉芳在幾年間接連「升呢」成為奶奶，且兩名新抱皆大方得體。兩位高顏值兒子相繼成家立室，一家人同住於2萬呎大坑豪宅內，過著幸福美滿的大家庭生活，網民紛紛送上祝福，指吳婉芳不僅保養得宜，更是真正的人生贏家。</p>\n<img alt=\"今年8月上山詩納生日，吳婉芳有份出席生日派對，外貌凍齡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bf0c9c0d1f746be245f70646a2347cc9/2026-08/785993254_18634940251038210_4355588244929792238_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳婉芳與子女關係非常好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/879fe02b3d50adbb1487f2e62c73967c/2023-05/family.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳婉芳與兩子遊東京，逆齡美貌曝光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/76287e69662052dc14fc0aaf8e497935/2023-05/NG1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳婉芳1986年奪得香港小姐亞軍，參選時得18歲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/590569dd00bf47e8fa7f38b0e7070099/2023-09/VS--YouTube-1986B-2_06_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"1896年入行後曾做不少司儀工作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ca3b0909bd9a7a17a52d3f5d451fdb3/2023-09/VS--YouTube-Danny1986-0_57_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳婉芳參選港姐後曾成為歌手，與鄭秀文及黎明等同期。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be0dc87fbb0a431d86cfa0000d723785/2023-05/DCENT38914012002.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳婉芳與商人胡家驊於1993年結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a663ed62256cef21d15697fd8e2daa57/2023-09/FSH1214WAIYIN004.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"2000年代初，吳婉芳仍有少女味。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/801212f74ce6f54605f9796e0974e667/2023-09/DCENT17715122004.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳婉芳不時以貴婦打扮出席宴會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/439c92421af7a1da9f1cfdfc4db2f90a/2023-09/DCENT40501012005.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"但淡妝下的吳婉芳依然似初出道時的樣子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b51fbbb2968a08948e1f37e968135431/2023-09/SDM04P02180404.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳婉芳丈夫胡家驊抱着當時六歲的長子胡智略。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/becdfc25702cffd795010558271e27e4/2023-05/FSH0525WAIYIN022.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳婉芳二仔晒出多年前的母子照，網民都指吳婉芳凍齡得恐怖。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2f445f0c2ac47e04fad1bf86a8475173/2023-09/1694182482882.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳婉芳獲二仔胡智同親手炮製曲奇冧爆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/92def0ccdf710319d70ef42dbecf160f/2025-05/VS----0_08__1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳婉芳獲二仔胡智同親手炮製曲奇冧爆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b09ca61656d908cd9453e684cd3f282d/2025-05/VS----0_23_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"片中可見，廚房設備完善，而且空間感十足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d967e637099f3511fd7d2458324b9da0/2025-05/VS----0_25_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"片中可見，廚房設備完善，而且空間感十足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/acb82471d144a9de901603a2b9c07d38/2025-05/VS----0_29_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡智同完成曲奇後，走到吳婉芳身處的客廳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4dd17cabc4c865528397319fbba01f77/2025-05/VS----0_35_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡智同完成曲奇後，走到吳婉芳身處的客廳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4adb1eef8498dcef9e00c71f114c9ed3/2025-05/VS----0_37_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳婉芳品嚐曲奇大讚美味。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dd5a210db3672f5ea4bf7b9fb632b7b8/2025-05/VS----0_43_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳婉芳身處的客廳可見，傢俬具高貴感，牆上掛上多幅全家福，增添溫馨感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7e10fc869175ce77535fb02c759b950f/2025-05/VS----0_45__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳婉芳身處的客廳可見，傢俬具高貴感，牆上掛上多幅全家福，增添溫馨感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a400e0386898e6ab1ae6abcbd99881e6/2025-05/VS----0_54_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"這棟8層高的獨立屋位於大坑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ed1c8d2aba401d1ce4eef578176d9f32/2025-05/yHyRRB__4PmkArRwQk24Pb9VeZl2ACfrFEWMXRRFjF0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"這棟8層高的獨立屋位於大坑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ff56dec7713d6488716267718259b792/2025-05/4tpQOhgWakgwNgEZN2rvfg81ijZlBwN37X2Eou19hKI.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"獨立屋外觀極具設計感，曾獲得國際設計及建築大獎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fe170e168871c3dba145e1249f21d63b/2025-05/7rjnbOPvgVx_gkP5dN_5FXd_5wkni6adDOg1nAzoNZw.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"獨立屋外觀極具設計感，曾獲得國際設計及建築大獎。\" src=\"https://image.h